+### 4. TRACK delta_f FOR EVERY SUCCESSFUL TRIAL
+When a trial is accepted and replaces the parent, store `delta_f = fitness[i] - trial_f` alongside `F_vals[i]` and `CR_vals[i]` in `S_delta`, `S_F`, `S_CR`.
